## Modern.js docs

Before changing Modern.js code, read the relevant version-matched page under
`node_modules/@modern-js/app-tools/docs/`. If missing, use
https://modernjs.dev/llms.txt.

Modern.js v3 uses `src/routes/`, `modern.config.ts` with `defineConfig`, and
`modern dev|build|serve`. There is no `modern new` command.

